Project 1 — House Price Prediction
Objective:
Predict house prices based on features such as area, number of bedrooms, bathrooms, location, and other
property characteristics.
Dataset Hint:
• Kaggle House Prices Dataset (https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/rehanliaqat17/houses-pricesdataset)
Problem Type: Regression
Steps:
1. Load & Inspect Data: pandas.read_csv(), .head(), .info(), .describe()
2. Clean Data: Handle missing values (dropna / fill median/mode), encode categorical features
with pd.get_dummies().
3. Feature Scaling: Use StandardScaler or MinMaxScaler.
4. EDA: Correlation heatmap, scatter plots with price, check outliers with boxplots.
5. Train/Test Split: train_test_split (80/20).
6. Model Suggestion: Linear Regression for baseline; Random Forest Regressor or XGBoost for
better performance.
7. Evaluation: RMSE, R², scatter plot of actual vs predicted prices. 
